 "name_en": "Central Purchase Contracts (2ME)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Central Purchase Contracts (2ME)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Central contracts are global long-term agreements negotiated between an organization and a supplier. This helps in getting the best rates and conditions while bundling purchasing volume across multiple subsidiaries. These contracts are typically negotiated by the central purchasing organization, mostly at the headquarters, and used for globally driving operational efficiency, reduced cost while complying with regulations across multiple subsidiaries.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The central contract, created at the headquarters, can be distributed to subsidiaries to generate local contracts or scheduling agreements. Subsidiaries can then continue with the operational procurement in a seamless manner by leveraging this local contract or Scheduling agreement. Central monitoring of contract consumption across subsidiaries and renewal of expiring contracts is easily managed by the headquarters.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create central purchase contract and distribution</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release central purchase contract (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check distributed purchase contracts or scheduling agreements in the back-end system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order or schedule lines in the back-end system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Import release orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt in the back-end system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice in the back-end system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo (optional) in the back-end system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform mass changes to central purchase contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor central purchase contract items (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create hierarchy central contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display version history in central purchase contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain formula and rate for commodity pricing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Lower your costs for contract negotiation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Lower your costs based on scaled purchasing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中采购合同 (2ME)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">集中合同是组织和供应商之间协商的全球长期协议。这有助于获取最佳费率和条件，同时捆绑多个子公司的采购量。这些合同通常由集中采购组织进行协商，主要在总部，用于全局提高运营效率、降低成本，同时遵守多个子公司的法规。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在总部创建的集中合同可以分配到子公司，以生成本地合同或计划协议。然后，子公司可以使用此本地合同或计划协议，以无缝的方式继续运营采购。总部可以轻松管理集中监控子公司的合同消耗，并续订即将到期的合同。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建集中采购合同和分配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批集中采购合同（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查后端系统中的已分配采购合同或计划协议。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在后端系统中创建采购订单或计划行。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导入批准订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在后端系统中过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在后端系统中创建供应商发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在后端系统中创建贷项凭证（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">对集中采购合同执行批量更改</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控集中采购合同项目（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建层次结构集中合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示集中采购合同中的版本历史记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护商品定价的公式和费率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob6c40a03f3674bb884b1c27ae123ace5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">降低合同谈判成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据规模化采购降低成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
